अ॑युक्त not yoked, not harnessed, not joined unconnected,
unappointed;
 not attentive or devout, unsuitable, unfit, improper,
wrong;
 abstr. ˚त्व† n.

आयुक्त a. yoked to (loc.), intent upon*, charged with (gen.
or loc.);
 m. (also ˚क) minister, agent.

1 आयु॑ a. living, lively, active;
 m. living creature, man,
mankind.

आयुर्वेद m. the science of health;
 T. of a book on
medicine.

2 आयुःशेष a. having a rest of life, not yet dead;
 abstr.
˚ता f.

आ॑युस् n. life, vitality, longevity;
 world ( = living
creatures).
